export anchor TropicalResortStyle:
    number: 28
    screen: LandingPage
    name: Tropical resort
    idea: A sunny resort brochure, with palm-leaf silhouettes, turquoise sea and coral sand tones, wavy edges, a postcard and relaxed rounded type.
    base: light
    palette:
        sand: #fbf1df, the page and control panels
        shell: #fffaf1, cards, the postcard, the quote band and fields
        lagoon: #bfe9e4, the hero horizon, the logo band and the menu button
        sea: #0a7f86, links, accent words and the focused field border
        deepWater: #064e57, text, headings and the footer
        coral: #c94a2f, the primary button and the focus outline, with #a8391f for small eyebrow text
        coralSand: #ffd9cc, the Overdue chip and the flower disc, with #ffe1c2 for the closing band
        sun: #ffc857, sun discs and footer headings on deep water, never text on light
        palm: #1e5a3c, leaf silhouettes and the On track chip text
        driftwood: #5c5246, body copy, notes and tag strings
        mango: #7a5600, At risk text on #fdecc2
        rust: #9a3b22, Overdue text
    type:
        A rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round,
        Quicksand, Arial Rounded MT Bold, Trebuchet MS, system-ui,
        sans-serif. The headline is 80px extra bold at 1.06 line height
        with its second half in sea. Section titles are 50px, the quote
        42px, feature titles 23px, all extra bold. The lede is 20px, body
        17px at 1.65 and chips 14px extra bold.
    layout:
        A top bar over the hero with a sun and waves mark, rounded nav links
        and a coral Start free button. The hero is a sand to lagoon sky
        gradient with a soft sun disc and faint palm leaves at the corners.
        The left holds a small shell pill with a sun icon, the headline,
        the lede, the buttons and the note with a wave icon. The right holds
        a slightly tilted postcard with a dashed inner border, a stamp of an
        island and the title Greetings from this week listing three projects
        and status chips. A wavy edge leads into a lagoon band where the
        logo names hang as luggage tags from a line. Three features are
        shell cards with tall arched tops holding small beach scene
        pictures. The quote sits on shell beside a coral flower disc with a
        pale palm leaf. The closing band is a peach sunset with a wavy top
        and a half sun. The footer is deep water with sun yellow headings.
        Below 960px the hero stacks, and below 760px the nav becomes a Menu
        disclosure.
    spacing: An 8px unit, 96px sections, 32px between cards and 56px between hero columns.
    density: Relaxed brochure pace. Large type, short lines, plenty of sky.
    corners: Soft everywhere. Arched card tops of 160px, 20 to 28px card corners, 18px fields, and a leaf shaped button rounded 26px except one 8px corner.
    borders: Almost none. A 2px dashed inner line on the postcard, 2px sand rules between rows and a dotted stamp edge.
    shadows: Warm teal drops of 0 24px 40px minus 28px rgba(6,78,87,0.5), and a solid darker coral lip under the primary button.
    icons:
        Small filled scene illustrations in palette colours inside the
        arched feature pictures, such as a window, a flag with a tick and a
        sun chart. Status chips are soft tinted pills with a filled circle
        tick for On track, a filled triangle with an exclamation mark for
        At risk and a rounded square with a cross for Overdue, beside the
        word.
    focus: A 3px coral outline offset 3px, sun yellow on deep water. A focused field adds a sea border and a soft sea glow.
    tone: Warm, unhurried holiday language, such as Greetings from this week and Everything your team needs to unwind.
